{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/e542d55e05d06e63bbf3dadd467d6f4889a15a6c2c43b46c812a48b6ee2adf7ff126e17cb0d3c04d4d2f24d216f00138ed4cd9cbf209538cb1bd0f4fd7ac7f15","height":2000,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ECgal03qq-GPHfoWRZft82d97qPwwB-M4z1d-igDCWWAMWhJteOVP4HzaU2XhhQVfG9ME-_0DWTFA1eK28kgnTgTHBpSnTIhLK8TQKwE0zyq_lFckrs","width":2000},"name":"James Williams","title":"Material Developer Advocate"},"document_id":5856972825690112,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>我们很高兴地宣布，Android 版 Material Design 组件（MDC-Android）1.10.0 正式发布。本次版本包含一系列功能变更与更新，完整列表请务必查看发布说明。</p>\n<h2>（应用内）预测性返回</h2>\n<p>预测性返回让用户在执行操作之前，就能看到滑动手势将把自己带往何处，通常通过缩放视图来揭示目标页面。在手势进行过程中的任何时刻，用户都可以取消并停留在当前页面。</p>\n<p>从 Android 14/API 级别 34 开始，除了 Android 13/API 33 中引入的预测性返回主屏幕之外，Android 还支持应用内各目标页面之间的预测性返回。</p>\n<p>启用预测性返回的一般步骤如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实现&ldquo;返回回调&rdquo;API（<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/window/OnBackAnimationCallback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><code>OnBackAnimationCallback</code></a>、<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/androidx/activity/OnBackPressedCallback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><code>OnBackPressedCallback</code></a>、<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/androidx/activity/OnBackPressedDispatcher\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><code>OnBackPressedDispatcher</code></a> 等）</li>\n<li>将 <code>android:enableOnBackInvokedCallback</code> 清单标志设置为 true</li>\n<li>弃用旧式返回导航（<code>Activity#onBackPressed</code>、<code>KeyEvent.KEYCODE_BACK</code> 等）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&lt;mio-video index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-video&gt;</p>\n<p>应用完成迁移后，涉及受支持组件的目标页面将自动获得预测性返回手势和动画。</p>\n<p>截至撰写本文时，这些组件是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>搜索栏 / SearchView</li>\n<li>底部面板（bottom sheet）</li>\n<li>侧边面板（side sheet）</li>\n<li>导航抽屉 / NavigationView</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如需在应用中实现预测性返回的详细指南，请参阅 <a href=\"http://developers.android.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">developers.android.com</a> 上的文档。</p>\n<p>我们的 MDC <a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/docs/foundations/PredictiveBack.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">预测性返回文档页面</a>是了解越来越多支持预测性返回的组件以及未来计划支持组件的最佳去处。</p>\n<h2>更新与变更</h2>\n<p>从本版本开始，最低 <code>compileSdkVersion</code> 为 34。</p>\n<p><strong>侧边面板</strong></p>\n<p>侧边面板（side sheet）在宣布 <a href=\"https://material.io/blog/android-stable-release-1-8-0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1.8.0</a> 版本的博文中首次亮相，用于承载与屏幕相关的补充信息。此前它们只能锚定在屏幕右侧。从 1.10.0 版本开始，它们可以锚定在屏幕的任意一侧。要进一步了解不同的侧边面板类型，请参阅那篇<a href=\"https://material.io/blog/android-stable-release-1-8-0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">博文</a>或侧边面板的<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/docs/components/SideSheet.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">文档页面</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>轮播的变更</strong></p>\n<p>在 <a href=\"https://material.io/blog/android-stable-release-1-9-0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1.9.0 发布公告</a>中引入的轮播有了一个新变体（<code>HeroCarouselStrategy</code>），它将内容对齐到起始位置，并采用&ldquo;主角&rdquo;（hero）策略，将轮播中的大部分空间分配给一个主要元素。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>BadgeDrawable</strong></p>\n<p>BadgeDrawable 常用于在导航组件中为条目添加标注，比如新消息/未读消息数量之类的文本，或无标签的形状，此次它迎来了一处小调整。</p>\n<p>之前，你可以将徽标对齐到锚点视图四个角中的任意一个。现在减少为两种对齐方式：<code>TOP_START</code> 和 <code>TOP_END</code>（默认）。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p><code>BOTTOM_START</code> 和 <code>BOTTOM_END</code> 已被弃用，不建议再使用。要进一步了解这些变更，请参阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/docs/components/BadgeDrawable.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BadgeDrawable 开发者文档</a>。</p>\n<h2>MDC 的下一步？</h2>\n<p>我们正全力开发 1.11.0 版本，其中包含对组件颜色使用方式的一些澄清性更新。我们在这些文章中着重介绍的组件或功能，只是每个版本所交付工作中的一小部分。完整列表请查看<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/tag/1.10.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">发布说明</a>。</p>\n<p>你可以在 GitHub 上关注新版本的进展、提交<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=bug&amp;template=bug_report.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+issue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">错误报告</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=feature+request&amp;template=feature_request.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+request\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">功能请求</a>。查看<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/download/1.10.0/catalog-debug.apk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">目录应用</a>可以看到这些组件的实际效果。也欢迎在 Twitter 上联系我们 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/materialdesign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@materialdesign</a>。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"carousel in the material catalog app","bordered":false,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/5785be12467c8d648db4dd7c958351449d0cc188432eabc3017fe07c92ce42ae9f1fbbb50908ff6b2f0e9a742f1a28cacdccfdd11858cecdbc97a74f88019cd2","height":2400,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/CCu0KuZwrZXgfaI_z1tvyzOpx1iip6IK7vXp9HD1iLRplnJGk5TE9LepSC7OvilkEz4tlfWVf-q4hdo0acUMkOW_GS_C0_2FcwuSmnC06zUbV1xj5FW3","width":3240}},{"a11y_description":"Bottom nav bar with badges","bordered":true,"caption":"TOP_START Alignment","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/7d5e682d5dcf85c4661cc28b04a365ab208c261ccc88dbd426188d1260f7f751fdf34a446dd3cb848dfc8e92252728e106c315195ee55062a12d763c1c6b6304","height":265,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/I2FShTZJ7bV7dszsQ437Y8Zu3u0CTdb_T0JJB-zE6EZB0TxpR74ULHo5tqKlByJlu1K97PeHyOzCCTbg8-ahllLzedwwLGXYkVmP3Gupm_vjW1NUaw","width":1080}},{"a11y_description":"Bottom nav bar with badges","bordered":true,"caption":"TOP_END Alignment (Default)","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/6f9a3e8e07e6eb974593315ea6db201ea1f31a3c66007a4e445d04dfae329cbea1912557670fcd109718ab677e61606c242171a84c87dd7a26b88e9c6edaf623","height":275,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/B24uqNiYvH9lJnZf6UnjbNx5VCQ-yGb8xbHsewo91MfBC0n0cQx5d4h891OLAYqTWvDrBSomScR6O5u1A0kWCr9V8MdZqZCVhrH3YEDgdEZuxusbDQ","width":1080}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[{"a11y_description":"predictive-back animation on android","autoplay":true,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_name":"lg549708-3P-Bottom_Sheet_Predictive_Back.mp4","file_path":"12607e68170650bb6a3e8279fb697f03347a022216efbc3c004183b912a657587fbf61a339729a76dae17a7efd61423dded1a17e7a8dbdf7e66f11197f991fd6","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/material-io-design/m2/assets/downloads/12607e68170650bb6a3e8279fb697f03347a022216efbc3c004183b912a657587fbf61a339729a76dae17a7efd61423dded1a17e7a8dbdf7e66f11197f991fd6.mp4"},"hide_controls":true,"loop":true,"muted":true,"silent":true}]}],"category":"2023","hero":{"a11y_description":"abstract flower and leaf illustration","bordered":false,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/8d4523e0afbaee132992816d92c69f9991c929d20c6dd42e9d93a5918721fc4054274114b9eaf03ba62ce895a1422b1268dd945dd52385e16ee5e55438ed1183","height":1200,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pR75LC3YTcz6E8rmRyB0FvLZPrvqzHwa-cHtTrrBe3yrNo1YUZLXQzHzvOKVGZZjjoc75U-KG8cvGFUthsfuYBugrUm5MKZNwvH37cw4NqM8EzkPCBI","width":2400}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":null,"meta_robots":null,"schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"MDC-Android 1.10.0 现已发布！了解预测性返回（Predictive Back）、侧边面板（side sheet）、轮播（carousel）等方面的最新更新。","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/3f34e820325175a38f01ee6ae5